---
const description = 'Interfaces with intention. Software with substance. Design, development, and independent thinking by funtohard.';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>funtohard — Design &amp; Development</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={Astro.site} />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/editorial.css" />
    <link rel="preload" href="/fonts/editorial-2.ttf" as="font" type="font/ttf" crossorigin />
    <meta property="og:title" content="funtohard — Design & Development" />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={Astro.site} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fdfcfb" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="folio">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a href="/" class="wordmark" aria-label="funtohard home"><span class="monogram" aria-hidden="true">f.</span><span>funtohard</span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/work/">Work</a><a href="/philosophy/">Thinking</a><a href="https://github.com/FunToHard">GitHub <img class="folio-icon" src="/icons/arrow-up-right.svg" alt="" /></a></nav>
      </header>
      <aside class="page-index" aria-label="On this page">
        <a href="#work"><span>01</span>Work</a><a href="#process"><span>02</span>Process</a><a href="#thinking"><span>03</span>Thinking</a>
      </aside>
      <main id="main">
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="headline">
          <p class="eyebrow hero-label">Design + software development</p>
          <div class="hero-grid">
            <h1 id="headline"><span><em>Nothing</em> here</span><span><em class="accent">is</em> accidental.</span></h1>
            <div class="intro-copy"><p>I'm funtohard. I design interfaces<br class="desktop-break" /> and develop software.<br />A collection of what I build, how I think,<br class="desktop-break" /> and the questions that shape my work.</p><a class="text-link" href="/work/">Inspect the work <img class="folio-icon" src="/icons/arrow-right.svg" alt="" /></a><div class="mode-control"><span>View</span><button type="button" id="inspect-toggle" aria-pressed="false">Read <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> Inspect</button></div></div>
          </div>
          <p class="inspection-note hero-note">01 / Editorial type gives ideas room. A strict grid keeps the rest in order.</p>
        </section>
        <section id="process" class="relationship" aria-label="From design to development">
          <p>I design what you see.</p><img class="annotation-flow" src="/images/annotation-flow.png" alt="" /><p class="relationship-end">and build what you don't.</p><pre aria-label="A way of working"><code><span>function</span> build() &#123;
  return ideas
    .map(design)
    .toProduct();
&#125;</code></pre>
          <p class="inspection-note process-note">02 / Astro for the showcase. TypeScript for the learning application. One shared visual language.</p>
        </section>
        <section id="work" class="selected-work" aria-labelledby="project-title">
          <div class="project-summary">
            <p class="eyebrow ruled">01 / Software for learning</p>
            <h2 id="project-title">R-mergency</h2>
            <p>A little clarity<br />before the exam.<br />Cram sheets, focused lessons,<br />and practice that sticks.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/R-mergency/">Open project <img class="folio-icon" src="/icons/arrow-right.svg" alt="" /></a>
            <p class="project-meta">Design / TypeScript / Learning tools</p>
          </div>
          <a class="project-collage" href="/R-mergency/" aria-label="Explore R-mergency, an exam preparation application">
            <img class="paper-backing" src="/images/project-paper.webp" alt="" />
            <img class="study-preview" src="/images/rmergency-study.png" alt="R-mergency syllabus with editorial headings, a module index, and readable code examples" width="1080" height="810" />
            <img class="drill-preview" src="/images/rmergency-drill.png" alt="R-mergency practice drill with answer choices and explanations" width="700" height="900" />
            <span class="collage-caption">Less noise.<br />More understanding.</span>
          </a>
          <aside id="thinking" class="thinking" aria-labelledby="thinking-title">
            <p class="eyebrow">02 / Thinking in public</p>
            <h2 id="thinking-title">In the<br /><em>margins.</em></h2>
            <p>Research, reflections,<br />and questions that<br />don't quite leave me alone.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/philosophy/">Read the philosophy <img class="folio-icon" src="/icons/arrow-right.svg" alt="" /></a>
            <p class="margin-note">Better interfaces<br />begin with<br />better questions.</p>
          </aside>
          <p class="inspection-note work-note">03 / The product images are captures of the working application. Open the project to try it.</p>
        </section>
        <footer><a href="/">funtohard</a><p>Made to be considered. Built to be used.</p><a href="https://github.com/FunToHard">Source &amp; experiments <img class="folio-icon" src="/icons/arrow-up-right.svg" alt="" /></a></footer>
      </main>
    </div>
    <script>
      const toggle = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#inspect-toggle');
      toggle?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const active = toggle.getAttribute('aria-pressed') !== 'true';
        toggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(active));
        document.body.classList.toggle('inspecting', active);
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 28px; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: var(--folio-paper); color: var(--folio-ink); font-family: var(--folio-sans); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(::selection) { background: #e9dff6; }
  a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  button { font: inherit; }
  .folio { max-width: 1536px; margin: auto; padding: 0 5.2%; position: relative; }
  .site-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; height: 100px; padding: 0 4%; }
  .wordmark { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -.7px; }
  .monogram { font: 600 66px/.8 var(--folio-display); letter-spacing: -6px; }
  nav { display: flex; gap: 35px; font-size: 14px; }
  nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
  nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 7px; }
  .page-index { position: absolute; top: 143px; left: 2.5%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 23px; font-size: 12px; }
  .page-index a { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .page-index a::after { content: ''; height: 1px; width: 18px; background: var(--folio-line); margin-top: 13px; }
  .page-index a:first-child span { color: var(--folio-accent); }
  .hero { padding: 22px 0 0 6.2%; position: relative; }
  .eyebrow { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2.1px; margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 25px; }
  .hero-label::before { content: ''; width: 38px; height: 1px; background: var(--folio-ink); }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 280px; gap: 37px; align-items: center; }
  h1 { font: 600 clamp(80px, 10.8vw, 164px)/.84 var(--folio-display); letter-spacing: -7px; margin: 0 0 25px; }
  h1>span { display: block; white-space: nowrap; }
  h1>span+span { margin-top: 14px; }
  h1 em { font-weight: 600; }
  .accent { color: var(--folio-accent); }
  .intro-copy { padding-top: 10px; }
  .intro-copy>p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .text-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--folio-ink); padding: 10px 0; }
  .text-link:hover { color: var(--folio-accent); border-color: var(--folio-accent); }
  .text-link img { transition: transform .2s; }
  .text-link:hover img { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .mode-control { margin-top: 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--folio-muted); }
  .mode-control button { background: none; border: 0; padding: 7px 0; color: var(--folio-ink); cursor: pointer; }
  .mode-control button span { padding: 0 5px; color: #b7acc5; }
  .mode-control button[aria-pressed=true] { color: var(--folio-accent); }
  .relationship { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 215px minmax(50px, 1fr) 225px 165px; gap: 12px; align-items: center; height: 110px; position: relative; padding: 0 0 0 3.4%; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .relationship>p:not(.inspection-note) { font: 500 23px var(--folio-display); white-space: nowrap; align-self: start; margin-top: 25px; }
  .relationship>.relationship-end { align-self: end !important; margin-bottom: 29px; }
  .annotation-flow { width: 100%; height: 125px; object-fit: cover; }
  .relationship pre { font: 11px/1.6 ui-monospace, monospace; color: #605082; background: #f6f4f7; padding: 14px; margin: 0; }
  .relationship code>span { color: var(--folio-accent); }
  .selected-work { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 330px minmax(0,1fr) 265px; min-height: 490px; position: relative; }
  .project-summary { z-index: 2; padding-top: 14px; pointer-events: none; }
  .project-summary a { pointer-events: auto; }
  .ruled { white-space: nowrap; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 13px; width: 460px; }
  .ruled::after { content: ''; height: 1px; flex: 1; background: var(--folio-line); }
  .project-summary h2 { font: 600 clamp(43px, 4.8vw, 72px)/1 var(--folio-display); letter-spacing: -3px; white-space: nowrap; margin: 37px 0 25px; }
  .project-summary>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.project-meta) { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 32px; }
  .project-summary .text-link { gap: 35px; }
  .project-meta { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .6px; margin-top: 22px; color: var(--folio-muted); max-width: 190px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .project-collage { position: relative; display: block; min-width: 0; height: 470px; margin: 0 10px 0 -15px; }
  .paper-backing { position: absolute; width: 122%; max-width: none; height: 100%; left: -10%; object-fit: fill; }
  .study-preview { position: absolute; width: 95%; height: 350px; object-fit: cover; object-position: left top; left: 0; top: 53px; transform: rotate(-1.4deg); border: 1px solid #d8d1e2; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px #21103f12; }
  .drill-preview { position: absolute; width: 48%; height: 348px; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; right: -1%; top: 92px; transform: rotate(3deg); border: 1px solid #d8d1e2; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px #21103f19; }
  .collage-caption { position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 20px; font: italic 500 18px/1.1 var(--folio-display); transform: rotate(-4deg); }
  .thinking { border-left: 1px solid #8c7fa4; padding: 14px 0 0 24px; margin-left: 26px; }
  .thinking .eyebrow { font-size: 9px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .thinking h2 { font: 600 60px/.87 var(--folio-display); letter-spacing: -2.5px; margin: 36px 0 28px; }
  .thinking>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.margin-note) { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .thinking .text-link { font-size: 14px; gap: 20px; }
  .margin-note { font: 500 italic 22px/1.1 var(--folio-display); color: var(--folio-muted); transform: rotate(-5deg); margin: 40px 0 0 12px; }
  footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--folio-line); padding: 22px 0 26px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 20px; gap: 20px; }
  footer p { color: var(--folio-muted); margin: 0; }
  footer a:last-child { display: inline-flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; }
  .inspection-note { display: none; color: #7b301e; background: #fff1eb; border-left: 2px solid var(--folio-accent); padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 10px 0; }
  :global(.inspecting) .inspection-note { display: block; }
  :global(.inspecting) .hero-grid, :global(.inspecting) .selected-work { outline: 1px dashed #b3a6c4; outline-offset: 8px; }
  :global(.inspecting) .relationship { height: auto; min-height: 140px; }
  :global(.inspecting) .process-note { position: static; grid-column: 1/-1; max-width: none; }
  .process-note { position: absolute; right: 15px; bottom: -10px; max-width: 420px; z-index: 3; }
  .work-note { grid-column: 1/-1; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; top: -80px; left: 20px; background: var(--folio-ink); color: white; padding: 12px; z-index: 20; }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 10px; }
  @media(min-width:1151px) { .relationship { margin-top: -14px; } .relationship>p:not(.inspection-note) { margin-top: 5px; } .relationship>.relationship-end { margin-bottom: 16px; } .project-collage { margin-left: 0; } }
  @media(min-width:1500px) { .folio { padding: 0 74px; } }
  @media(max-width:1150px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) 225px; gap: 20px; } h1 { font-size: 10.5vw; letter-spacing: -5px; } .intro-copy>p { font-size: 13px; } .selected-work { grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0,1fr) 215px; } .project-summary h2 { font-size: 55px; } .thinking { padding-left: 18px; margin-left: 15px; } .thinking h2 { font-size: 52px; } .relationship { grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(30px,1fr) 200px 145px; } .relationship>p:not(.inspection-note) { font-size: 21px; } .relationship pre { font-size: 10px; } .study-preview { height: 320px; } .drill-preview { height: 315px; } }
  @media(max-width:850px) { .folio { padding: 0 28px; } .site-header { padding: 0; height: 90px; } .page-index { display: none; } .hero { padding: 22px 0 0; } .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 15px; } h1 { font-size: 15.2vw; margin-bottom: 0; } .intro-copy { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 0 25px; align-items: center; } .intro-copy>p { font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; } .intro-copy .text-link { align-self: center; } .mode-control { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; margin-top: 0; } .relationship { grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 210px; padding: 0; height: 130px; margin-top: 5px; } .relationship pre { display: none; } .selected-work { grid-template-columns: 185px minmax(0,1fr); } .thinking { grid-column: 1/-1; margin: 20px 0 0; padding: 25px 0; border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--folio-line); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px 30px; align-items: center; } .thinking h2 { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2/4; margin: 0; font-size: 60px; } .thinking>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.margin-note) { margin: 0; } .thinking .text-link { justify-self: start; } .margin-note { display: none; } .project-collage { height: 440px; } .ruled { width: 350px; } footer { margin-top: 0; } }
  @media(max-width:550px) { .folio { padding: 0 22px; } .site-header { height: 83px; } .wordmark { gap: 10px; font-size: 14px; } .monogram { font-size: 52px; } nav { gap: 17px; font-size: 12px; } nav .folio-icon { width: 12px; } .hero-label { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: 1.6px; margin-bottom: 25px; gap: 10px; } .hero-label::before { width: 22px; } h1 { font-size: 15.7vw; letter-spacing: -2.8px; line-height: .96; } h1>span+span { margin-top: 0; } .hero-grid { gap: 22px; } .intro-copy { display: block; padding-top: 0; } .intro-copy>p { font-size: 14px; } .intro-copy .text-link { margin-top: 10px; } .mode-control { margin-top: 8px; } .relationship { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; height: 120px; margin: 18px 0 10px; } .relationship>p:not(.inspection-note) { font-size: 19px; position: relative; z-index: 1; margin-top: 0; } .relationship>p.relationship-end { margin-bottom: 0; white-space: normal; text-align: right; } .annotation-flow { position: absolute; width: 75%; height: 80px; top: 20px; left: 9%; } .selected-work { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .project-summary { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 0 16px; padding-top: 5px; } .ruled { grid-column: 1/-1; width: 100%; font-size: 9px; } .project-summary h2 { margin: 24px 0 18px; font-size: 56px; grid-column: 1/-1; } .project-summary>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.project-meta) { font-size: 14px; margin: 0; } .project-summary .text-link { align-self: center; font-size: 13px; gap: 18px; } .project-meta { grid-column: 1/-1; max-width: none; margin: 14px 0 0; } .project-collage { margin: 10px 0 0; height: 365px; } .study-preview { top: 40px; height: 260px; width: 91%; } .drill-preview { top: 77px; height: 268px; width: 46%; } .collage-caption { bottom: 0; font-size: 16px; } .paper-backing { height: 100%; width: 110%; left: -5%; } .thinking { gap: 15px 18px; padding-top: 25px; margin-top: 15px; } .thinking .eyebrow { grid-column: 1/-1; } .thinking h2 { font-size: 48px; } .thinking>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.margin-note) { font-size: 12px; } .thinking .text-link { font-size: 12px; gap: 8px; } footer { font-size: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; } footer p { order: 3; width: 100%; } .process-note { max-width: 100%; bottom: -16px; font-size: 9px; } }
</style>
